{
  "title": "Oozing Slovakian Tofu Wrap",
  "description": "A tangy, cheese-pull wrap inspired by Slovakian flavors, featuring miso-marinated tofu, kaffir lime leaf, and a fresh agave-leaf vessel.",
  "cuisine": "Slovakian",
  "diet": [
